{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"disableLinkedCard"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When disabled, only the main card will be presented during contactless payment transactions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The link between the cards remains intact and can be re-enabled using "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TSHPaySDK\/documentation\/TSHPaySDK\/DigitalCard\/enableLinkedCard()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This operation updates the link state in secure storage and propagates the change to the payment system."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TSHPaySDK\/documentation\/TSHPaySDK\/DigitalCard\/Error\/cardNotLinked","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" if this card is not currently linked to an alternate card."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TSHPaySDK\/documentation\/TSHPaySDK\/DigitalCard\/linkCard(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to establish a link first."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TSHPaySDK\/documentation\/TSHPaySDK\/DigitalCard\/Error\/clientError(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" if the operation fails due to storage errors or if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-setting the default card failsdue to an error in storage or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the default card cannot be reset (because this is the default card)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"automatically be reset as"}]}]}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If this card is currently set as the default card, it will automatically be reset as the default card"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after the link is disabled. This ensures that the updated PPSE (Proximity Payment System Environment)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data is properly propagated to the payment system. If this reset operation fails, the link"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state will be rolled back to enabled."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Disabling the link does not remove the linking between the cards. To permanently remove the link, use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TSHPaySDK\/documentation\/TSHPaySDK\/DigitalCard\/unlinkCard()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TSHPaySDK\/documentation\/TSHPaySDK\/DigitalCard\/enableLinkedCard()","type":"reference"},{"text":" to enable a previously disabled card link.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"See Also","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TSHPaySDK\/documentation\/TSHPaySDK\/DigitalCard\/unlinkCard()","isActive":true},{"text":" to permanently remove the link between cards.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"See Also","style":"note"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text"